  "_README": "One rulebook per season. Items carry a stable `id`, which is what makes the year-over-year diff meaningful: copy a season with tools/new_rulebook.py and the ids come with it, so an edited item reads as CHANGED rather than as a delete plus an add. `status` is draft or published; drafts are only visible to a signed-in commissioner.",
